# The image needs the server, the core it links, and the catalog. Everything
# else in this repository is either a build artifact or the client, and
# server/target alone is 1.1 GB of it -- sent to the daemon as build context it
# would dominate the build time of a build that does not use one byte of it.
*
!server
!sim
!catalog
server/target
!sandbox-ca.crt
